{
  "dom_id": "step-607425",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Identifying the Coordinates of a Point",
  "problem": "What are the $xy$-coordinates of the point $D$ shown below?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129504/assets/c546e2deb5b19c0068fd4ad550f97d3ee3143ec75bf96ca59ce5c44b825ab79e.png)",
  "worked_solution": "To find the coordinates of $D,$ we inspect its position along the $x$ and $y$ axes.\n\nThe point $D$ is $3$ units to the *left* of the origin, in the *negative* direction of the $x$-axis. So, $D$ has an $x$-coordinate of $-3.$\n\nAdditionally, the point $D$ is $2$ units *below* the origin, in the *negative* direction of the $y$-axis. So, $D$ has a $y$-coordinate of $-2.$\n\nThe point $D$ has an $x$-coordinate of $-3$ and a $y$-coordinate of $-2,$ so its coordinates are $(-3,-2).$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-607425\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"607425\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"975\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-607425\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-7\">Identifying the Coordinates of a Point</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"607425\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                          